# Installed at /etc/caddy/Caddyfile on the Vultr box (apt caddy, systemd). After editing: scp it there, then `systemctl reload caddy`.
# Managed for OmniRisk. api. is the backend (REST and websockets); the bare domain is Cam's web app (nginx container on 127.0.0.1:8080).
